GameModeText: {
	BrutalName: Cruel World
	AsuraName: Asura Hell
	AnnihilationName: Death's End
	BrutalOnLine: This world is cruel, and yet you love it still.
	BrutalOffLine: The world sheathes its fangs. Its mercy is only a pause.
	AsuraOnLine: The Asura path opens. Every pain you deal shall be repaid in full.
	AsuraOffLine: The Asura path closes. All debts are settled.
	AnnihilationOnLine: All shall pass; only Death lives forever.
	AnnihilationOffLine: Death rests a while; the living steal a breath.
	BrutalDesc: Unleashes the reworked, merciless AI of brutal foes, their stats anchored no lower than Master Mode; all other enemies gain 50% more life and damage, and lesser fiends turn swift and frenzied
	AsuraDesc: The enhancement rises to 100%. Foes adapt to repeated damage of the same kind, and any blow you deal sets the least they deal back
	AnnihilationDesc: The final form of Asura Hell in a zenith world. Every terror doubles again: foes adapt twice as fast, and your pain is repaid twofold
	StateOn: Active
	StateOff: Dormant
	HintEnable: Click to awaken
	HintDisable: Click to seal
	BossRefuse: A boss still lives. The pact cannot be altered now
}
